# Files in this directory NOT to publish as static assets.
# Without this, https://devdeck.sh/wrangler.toml would 200.
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
README.md

# Releases never ship through Static Assets — they live in R2 on
# dl.devdeck.sh (25 MiB-per-file Static Assets limit would block them
# and fail the whole deploy). Belt-and-braces if anything cp's a zip
# into the working tree.
*.zip
*.delta
